  "changelog": "Initial release \u2014 authoritative Java design patterns and principles reference.\n\n- Covers 182 design patterns across 15 categories, plus 26 core programming principles.\n- Includes GoF 23 standard patterns, enterprise architecture, concurrency, and microservice patterns.\n- Provides concise Java code samples for 7 essential patterns for quick reference.\n- Quick index and documentation links for all included design principles (KISS, DRY, SOLID, etc.).\n- Prioritizes answering \"why\" via principles before \"how\" with specific patterns.\n- Automatically triggers for user questions on design patterns, principles, architecture, or Java implementations.",
